    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4460cbba95bd4202b45169a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――――综上所述，圣女就此降临了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99df0e26518132cd6ec19c800b322885f2bd42357eb80935ffed7106793235d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff93ba48d42dc137828d4eb6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "果不其然，我的名字没有被念到。\n明明早在预料之中……可我还是像逃跑一般，急匆匆地离开了现场……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5f156f1bbfd57f54622ccccef763cd2c65a2c217ea47a795606507cfd4bc425",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d762f43b47930e6457854e9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……看来是我误解她了。原以为她是还没有尝过挫折的滋味，\n所以才能继续做着这般美梦，这些全是我擅自先入为主的臆测。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08c010319d38216eb0a5ed7dedd657aa3b8945ce76233f4f1be21158917239bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88f6206ed792e353d87a4c3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果我……也能这么想就好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "797c94fa26e1ba47f80b4e517642963e9372cdae32a07166c3c1eafacc254373",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6378c09bd240463cd055c7ed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果我……也能这么想就好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "797c94fa26e1ba47f80b4e517642963e9372cdae32a07166c3c1eafacc254373",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
