    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8b68626fd54f1bee056caa2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她所拥有的不过是小孩子般单纯的渴望被认可的心情。\n然而，当这种信念彻底贯彻到极致时——反倒令人感到一阵澄澈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab90910dbb714ab14a94798ff11aa1f76f28805633aee68c7c432640efd9428",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0deac12a86c9f51d0b2d8778",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d415c5280862befd317a57a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵……不是和您说过了吗。这是普遍的神话。亦是所有人灵魂最深处的原初记忆。\n如果是被尘封在内心深处的宝石，那只需将其重新唤醒即可。",
      "source_fingerprint": "286e58a9cf2389056152e4de9390ac76c7a0ebe156cc621452307414a45b2466",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b5449c570da51b8c5bc3d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d19c59b97f26f0d3a820ee7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "难道您，从未觉得自己是特别的存在过吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "380af080ab43dd754437fba04cf96e843283071612acafd891136d5c95030ab2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17db4677054f158ae27d36d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "………………有过",
      "source_fingerprint": "785444256426dc160fdb2958de01c75a811548d8a07db536a978ff9bb180d1db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f517d56108765c236a02b91",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说完，她便默默地注视着我。\n那坦率直白的话语瞬间刺入我的心扉，我不由得挤出了一句回答。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb7e275dbc68dee5b7c9ea9309d4a186d9df614eaa08023580b3ea14d0e86bce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e66e2c218fd2510dcdae80a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
