    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb01ecb8c58795e581ea4ba4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——第二天清晨，心里突然感到无比轻松。\n是因为深埋心底的执念终于被释放出来的缘故吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9badf042027ab02a3f18dffde7ef7c5cb7075994ebb77f78a35e122433d4427",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bbc270bf2a80287095f4854",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也许，人生还远远没到向自己妥协放弃的时候……。\n带着这份信念，我开始全力以赴地去面对眼前的每一项工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04374f46f2f74489aac33fdd71c9fafca64b57d18b5e13c9f3bf53995dd0bfa7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bba6aa204c892a76bd8a4c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（为什么事到如今，胸口还会隐隐作痛呢——）",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c6ddc0cf5c5324619c568bbc7ac6f85c97e5de733e04ecb923ce066cb93b0b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
